<section class="hero" id="top">
    <p class="eyebrow">Image-first visual search · MVP</p>
    <h2 class="hero-title">Search with an image,<br><span class="grad">not words.</span></h2>
    <p class="hero-sub">
        Saka-irs fingerprints every image you add, then finds exact duplicates,
        near duplicates and perceptually similar images across your own library —
        locally, privately, and with every result honestly labeled.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-motif" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="chip">IMAGE</span>
        <span class="motif-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="chip chip-accent">SEARCH</span>
        <span class="motif-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="chip chip-alt">VISUAL RESULTS</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#tool">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" />
                <path d="M16.5 16.5 L21 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
            Start searching
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#questions">See what it answers</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="panel" id="tool">
    <h2>Search or index an image</h2>
    <p class="muted">The image is the primary input. Add optional context hints below — hints drive external corpus
        providers, never replace visual search.</p>

    <form id="saka-form">
        <div id="dropzone" class="dropzone" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Choose an image">
            <img id="preview" class="preview hidden" alt="Selected image preview">
            <div id="dropzone-hint" class="dz-hint">
                <svg class="dz-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="1.6" />
                    <circle cx="9" cy="9.5" r="1.8" fill="currentColor" />
                    <path d="M4.5 17.5 L10 12 L14 15.5 L17 13 L19.5 15.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                        stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                </svg>
                <p>Click, drop, or paste (Ctrl+V) an image here</p>
                <p class="muted">JPEG · PNG · WebP · GIF · AVIF · TIFF — max <span id="max-size-label">15</span>MB</p>
            </div>
            <input type="file" id="image-input" name="image" accept="image/*" hidden>
        </div>

        <fieldset class="hints">
            <legend>Contextual hints (optional — drives external archive discovery)</legend>
            <div class="hint-grid">
                <label>Keyword <input type="text" name="keyword" maxlength="120"
                        placeholder="e.g. safari, lion, banner"></label>
                <label>Location <input type="text" name="location" maxlength="120"
                        placeholder="e.g. Nairobi, Kenya"></label>
                <label>Name <input type="text" name="name" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Savanna Sunset"></label>
                <label>Organization <input type="text" name="organization" maxlength="120"
                        placeholder="e.g. Wildlife Trust"></label>
                <label>Username <input type="text" name="username" maxlength="120"
                        placeholder="e.g. @photographer"></label>
            </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="actions">
            <button type="submit" data-action="search" class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Saka — Search</button>
            <button type="submit" data-action="index" class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>Add to Library</button>
        </div>

        <p id="form-status" class="status hidden" role="status"></p>
    </form>
</section>

<section class="panel hidden" id="results-panel">
    <h2>Results</h2>
    <div id="provider-strip" class="provider-strip"></div>
    <div id="results-container"></div>
</section>

<template id="result-card-template">
    <article class="result-card">
        <a class="thumb-link"><img class="thumb" alt="Result thumbnail"></a>
        <div class="result-body">
            <p class="result-title"></p>
            <div class="badges">
                <span class="badge matchtype"></span>
                <span class="badge confidence"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="result-meta"></p>
        </div>
    </article>
</template>

<section class="info-section" id="how">
    <h3 class="section-title">How it works</h3>
    <div class="cards-3">
        <article class="card">
            <span class="step-num">1</span>
            <svg class="icon card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.7" />
                <path d="M8 7 V5.5 A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 9.5 4 h5 A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 16 5.5 V7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                    stroke-width="1.7" />
                <path d="M3 13 h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="2.5 2.5" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Add to Library</h4>
            <p>Every image is validated, normalized — orientation, alpha, grayscale, fixed resize — then fingerprinted
                into 64-bit pHash, dHash and aHash signatures.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
            <span class="step-num">2</span>
            <svg class="icon card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" />
                <path d="M16.5 16.5 L21 21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" />
                <path d="M8.5 11 a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Saka — Search</h4>
            <p>Your query gets fingerprinted the exact same way, then Hamming distance ranks every library candidate in
                milliseconds — fully offline.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
            <span class="step-num">3</span>
            <svg class="icon card-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 3 L14.6 9 L21 9.6 L16.2 13.8 L17.7 20 L12 16.6 L6.3 20 L7.8 13.8 L3 9.6 L9.4 9 Z"
                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            </svg>
            <h4>Evidence, classified</h4>
            <p>Matches are labeled exact / near duplicate / visually similar with Strong–Weak confidence buckets — never
                a fake cross-provider percentage.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="info-section" id="questions">
    <h3 class="section-title">The five questions Saka-irs answers</h3>
    <div class="cards-q">
        <article class="q-card">
            <div class="q-head"><span class="q-num">Q1</span><span class="phase-badge live">Live</span></div>
            <h4>Have I seen this image before?</h4>
            <p>Local perceptual matching across everything you have indexed.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="q-card">
            <div class="q-head"><span class="q-num">Q2</span><span class="phase-badge live">Live</span></div>
            <h4>Is there a modified version of it?</h4>
            <p>pHash / dHash / aHash catch resizes, recompression and edits.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="q-card future">
            <div class="q-head"><span class="q-num">Q3</span><span class="phase-badge">Phase 2</span></div>
            <h4>Does another image share its features?</h4>
            <p>Feature matching for crops and partial images — OpenCV ORB/SIFT.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="q-card future">
            <div class="q-head"><span class="q-num">Q4</span><span class="phase-badge">Phase 3</span></div>
            <h4>Which images visually resemble it?</h4>
            <p>Semantic similarity via CLIP embeddings and vector search.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="q-card future">
            <div class="q-head"><span class="q-num">Q5</span><span class="phase-badge">Optional</span></div>
            <h4>Where does it exist externally?</h4>
            <p>ToS-compliant reverse-image discovery — never enabled by default.</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>